#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:2
msgid "Development Processes"
msgstr "Udviklingsprocesser"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:5
msgid "New Features"
msgstr "Nye funktioner"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:6
msgid ""
"This document outlines the process that is in place to propose new features "
"that can be added to phpBB. phpBB uses this system to assure that a given "
"feature is added as proposed and to make sure that feature requests are "
"handled transparently by relying on community input."
msgstr ""
"Dette dokument beskriver den proces, der er indført til at foreslå nye "
"funktioner, der kan tilføjes til phpBB. phpBB bruger dette system til at "
"sikre, at en given funktion tilføjes som foreslået, og for at sikre, at "
"funktionsanmodninger håndteres gennemsigtigt ved at basere sig på input fra "
"fællesskabet."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:10
msgid ""
"When proposing features or adjustments to phpBB, there are two possible "
"routes to take:"
msgstr ""
"Når man foreslår funktioner eller justeringer til phpBB, er der to mulige "
"veje at gå:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:12
msgid "**Ideas**"
msgstr "**Idéer**"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:13
msgid ""
"Generally more informal ideas from a user perspective. Usually short "
"descriptions without too much technical detail."
msgstr ""
"Generelt mere uformelle idéer set fra et brugerperspektiv. Som regel korte "
"beskrivelser uden for mange tekniske detaljer."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:15
msgid "**Feature Requests**"
msgstr "**Funktionsanmodninger**"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:16
msgid ""
"More technical proposal for new features. Should take a deeper look at the "
"technical background and ways to implement this new feature. Base for "
"further discussions with the development team."
msgstr ""
"Mere teknisk forslag til nye funktioner. Bør se nærmere på den tekniske "
"baggrund og måder at implementere den nye funktion på. Udgangspunkt for "
"videre diskussioner med udviklingsteamet."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:19
msgid ""
"In the end, both of these will end up following the same general process:"
msgstr "I sidste ende vil begge disse følge den samme generelle proces:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:24
msgid "Ideas"
msgstr "Idéer"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:25
msgid ""
"Ideas are generally more informal ideas that describe the request for a new "
"feature from the user perspective. They are aimed at quickly gathering new "
"ideas based on day to day use of phpBB."
msgstr ""
"Idéer er generelt mere uformelle idéer, der beskriver ønsket om en ny "
"funktion set fra brugerens perspektiv. De sigter mod hurtigt at indsamle nye"
" idéer baseret på den daglige brug af phpBB."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:28
msgid ""
"Informal Ideas should be proposed in `phpBB Ideas "
"<https://www.phpbb.com/community/ideas>`_. There it's possible to both "
"gather feedback and support of other users."
msgstr ""
"Uformelle idéer bør foreslås på `phpBB Ideas "
"<https://www.phpbb.com/community/ideas>`_. Der er det muligt både at "
"indsamle feedback og opbakning fra andre brugere."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:31
msgid ""
"More detailed technical discussions should however take place in a *Feature "
"request*."
msgstr ""
"Mere detaljerede tekniske diskussioner bør dog finde sted i en "
"*funktionsanmodning*."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:34
msgid "Feature Requests"
msgstr "Funktionsanmodninger"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:35
msgid ""
"In contrast to the above mentioned *Ideas*, a *Feature Request* should be "
"focused more on the technical solution for the proposed feature. They maybe "
"be based on an *Idea* but that is not mandatory."
msgstr ""
"I modsætning til de ovennævnte *idéer* bør en *funktionsanmodning* fokusere "
"mere på den tekniske løsning for den foreslåede funktion. Den kan være "
"baseret på en *idé*, men det er ikke obligatorisk."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:38
msgid ""
"New feature requests can either be started by creating a ticket in the "
"`phpBB Tracker <https://tracker.phpbb.com/>`_ or by creating a new "
"discussion topic on the `Area51 Forums <https://area51.phpbb.com/phpBB/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Nye funktionsanmodninger kan enten startes ved at oprette en sag i `phpBB "
"Tracker <https://tracker.phpbb.com/>`_ eller ved at oprette et nyt "
"diskussionsemne på `Area51-forummene <https://area51.phpbb.com/phpBB/>`_."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:41
msgid ""
"Try to describe the technical details of the proposed features, how it will "
"be used, and recommendations for an possible implementation. Include your "
"expectations of the amount of changes that are needed and attempt to discuss"
" the complexity of the proposal."
msgstr ""
"Forsøg at beskrive de tekniske detaljer for den foreslåede funktion, hvordan"
" den vil blive brugt, og anbefalinger til en mulig implementering. Angiv "
"dine forventninger til omfanget af de nødvendige ændringer, og forsøg at "
"diskutere forslagets kompleksitet."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:45
msgid ""
"Members of the community will be able to participate in the discussion, give"
" their feedback, and help with preparing a plan on how to best implement the"
" feature in small and easy to track steps."
msgstr ""
"Medlemmer af fællesskabet vil kunne deltage i diskussionen, give deres "
"feedback og hjælpe med at forberede en plan for, hvordan funktionen bedst "
"implementeres i små og lette at spore trin."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:49
msgid "Feature Acceptance"
msgstr "Godkendelse af funktion"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:50
msgid ""
"After a feature has been accepted by the *phpBB Development Team*, there "
"should be at least one ticket in the `phpBB Tracker "
"<https://tracker.phpbb.com/>`_. A new feature should be split up into "
"smaller, intermediate steps to ease implementation and review of the "
"proposed changes. It is also possible to use *Epics* in the tracker for a "
"better overview of necessary steps."
msgstr ""
"Efter en funktion er blevet accepteret af *phpBB Development Team*, bør der "
"være mindst én sag i `phpBB Tracker <https://tracker.phpbb.com/>`_. En ny "
"funktion bør opdeles i mindre, mellemliggende trin for at lette "
"implementeringen og gennemgangen af de foreslåede ændringer. Det er også "
"muligt at bruge *Epics* i trackeren for at få et bedre overblik over de "
"nødvendige trin."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:55
msgid ""
"Each step of a feature can then be reviewed and integrated separately. As a "
"result of that, code reviews will be easier, quicker, and should also result"
" in overall better code and features."
msgstr ""
"Hvert trin af en funktion kan derefter gennemgås og integreres separat. Som "
"følge heraf bliver kodegennemgange nemmere, hurtigere og bør også resultere "
"i overordnet bedre kode og funktioner."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:59
msgid "Implementation & Review"
msgstr "Implementering og gennemgang"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:60
msgid ""
"Implementation of a feature or its intermediate steps usually follows the "
"acceptance by the *phpBB Development Team*. All code needs to follow our "
"`Coding Guidelines <coding_guidelines.html>`_. The implementation itself can"
" be done by the requester, a *phpBB Development Team* member, or any other "
"developer. Feature acceptance by the *phpBB Development Team* does not mean "
"that implementation of it is mandatory or that it will have to be "
"implemented by the *phpBB Development Team* itself."
msgstr ""
"Implementeringen af en funktion eller dens mellemliggende trin følger "
"normalt godkendelsen fra *phpBB Development Team*. Al kode skal følge vores "
"`kodningsretningslinjer <coding_guidelines.html>`_. Selve implementeringen "
"kan udføres af den, der har fremsat anmodningen, et medlem af *phpBB "
"Development Team*, eller enhver anden udvikler. Godkendelse af en funktion "
"fra *phpBB Development Team* betyder ikke, at implementeringen er "
"obligatorisk, eller at den skal udføres af *phpBB Development Team* selv."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:66
msgid ""
"When using external libraries, please make sure that they are compatible "
"with our license. If you are unsure about whether a certain type of license "
"is acceptable, please ask the *phpBB Development Team*. PHP libraries "
"**MUST** be installed with composer and should generally be considered well "
"maintained."
msgstr ""
"Når du bruger eksterne biblioteker, skal du sørge for, at de er kompatible "
"med vores licens. Hvis du er usikker på, om en bestemt type licens er "
"acceptabel, bedes du spørge *phpBB Development Team*. PHP-biblioteker "
"**SKAL** installeres med composer og bør generelt anses for at være "
"velvedligeholdte."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:70
msgid ""
"Once the code is ready to be reviewed, a pull request should be created in "
"our `GitHub repository <https://github.com/phpbb/phpbb/pulls>`_. Target "
"versions should be picked in accordance with `Target Versions`_."
msgstr ""
"Når koden er klar til gennemgang, bør der oprettes en pull request i vores "
"`GitHub-repository <https://github.com/phpbb/phpbb/pulls>`_. Målversioner "
"bør vælges i overensstemmelse med `Målversioner`_."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:74
msgid "Finalisation / Feature Merge"
msgstr "Finalisering / sammenlægning af funktion"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:75
msgid ""
"After the code has been reviewed by the *phpBB Development Team*, it is "
"typically approved and merged. In case there are issues with the code, these"
" should be resolved as part of the code review. It can however also make "
"sense to create follow-up tickets to take care of some additional work or "
"adjustments to the proposed feature."
msgstr ""
"Efter koden er blevet gennemgået af *phpBB Development Team*, bliver den "
"typisk godkendt og sammenlagt. Hvis der er problemer med koden, bør disse "
"løses som en del af kodegennemgangen. Det kan dog også give mening at "
"oprette opfølgende sager til at tage sig af yderligere arbejde eller "
"justeringer af den foreslåede funktion."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/processes.rst:79
msgid ""
"Once a pull request has been merged, typical follow-up work should be adding"
" documentation for the new feature, creating blog posts as a form of pre-"
"announcement, or starting work on the next intermediate step."
msgstr ""
"Når en pull request er blevet sammenlagt, bør typisk opfølgende arbejde "
"bestå i at tilføje dokumentation for den nye funktion, oprette blogindlæg "
"som en form for forhåndsannoncering, eller påbegynde arbejdet med det næste "
"mellemliggende trin."

